      ],
      "title": "#1 吾名为“弑神”"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3800001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吕布",
          "text": "哇呀呀呀呀！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3800002",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "此般奋勇，教吾甚是宽慰！哼哈哈哈哈，理应如此！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3800003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "这……究竟是一场怎样的战斗啊……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3800004",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "我不能在允许这样的情况发生下去了。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3800005",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "可是岩田和江……你到底……应该怎样去做？",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3800006",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "强行剥离表皮的涂装，优纪她不就会……变成白模吗？可恶啊！",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3800007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "只有这种程度吗？怎么了？再来为吾制造更多的欢愉啊！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3800008",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "像虫子一样匍匐在地，屈辱的舔舐吾的双足。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3800009",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "一边用欲求不满的卑微的姿态，一边祈求吾的赦免啊——！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3800010",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "吕布",
          "text": "你的那双臭脚，快给我死一边去啊啊啊啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3800011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "哼，已经开始有些厌倦了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3800012",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "唔哈哈哈，就让内脏翻涌出鲜花。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3800013",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "就让吾之姿态，深深的烙刻在汝空寂的灵魂之中罢！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-196",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "exceldata",
          "rowIds": [
            3800001,
