      ],
      "title": "#3 逆转的号角"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3820001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "无法插手……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3820002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "这种奇怪的作战方式，怎么说，在下还是第一次看到！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3820003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "嗯！今天也是学习到新作战技巧的一天！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3820004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "玲前辈…… ",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3820005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "哎呀呀，你也察觉到了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3820006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "嗯！优纪前辈身体表层的涂料……就像那时候一样，在慢慢剥落……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3820007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "可是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3820008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "欸？有发现什么吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3820009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "嗯！内层的涂装不像是纯粹的白模……而有一些斑驳的，蓝色！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3820010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "你的意思是？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3820011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "前辈……花迦……并不敢随意妄下结论。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3820012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "因为……一旦有预期之外的情况发生，会……会对不起主人的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3820013",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "混蛋混蛋混蛋，少给吾大放厥词了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3820014",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "吾：优·|101|·T·常非·江和田岩·Yrret·迦花·纪！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3820015",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "正是不可战胜之存在！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-198",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "exceldata",
          "rowIds": [
            3820001,
