      ],
      "title": "#5 放弃的理由"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3840001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吕布",
          "text": "哈哈，来追我啊~~来追我啊~~~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3840002",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "死吧！死吧！死吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3840003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吕布",
          "text": "欸嘿嘿……就是追不到我！你就是追不到我！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3840004",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "想不到，吾竟跳出此等拙劣的舞蹈！",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3840005",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "切……这实在远并非吾之强项！",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3840006",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "可恶，吾的脚踝！卡在齿轮之中了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3840007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吕布",
          "text": "欸嘿嘿，像大风车一样，转起来……转起来吧……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3840008",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "愚物！吾命令汝，快停下来！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3840009",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "好……恶心……住手……我要晕了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3840010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "请你……快点放手啊……优纪的头……好晕！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3840011",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "唔啊啊啊啊，吾是不会如此屈服的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3840012",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "齿轮的旋转越来越快，在离心力作用下，优纪身上表层的「紫色颜料」尽数脱落。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3840013",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "伤痕累累的身体上，内层斑驳的蓝色涂料和最外层由你曾亲手涂上的，代表少女鲜明个性的黄色，彼此相互照应。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3840014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "求求你……请……放我下来吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3840015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "吾……我、我好……我好累……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3840016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吕布",
          "text": "真没劲。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3840017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吕布",
          "text": "拜拜，去找别的新鲜喽。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3840018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "大脑……完全要失去意识了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3840019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我……到底在哪里……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
